# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:14
translate italian jamietv1_917dd9af:

    # "I follow Jamie into the living room and sit down on the couch next to her."
    "Seguo Jamie in salotto e mi siedo sul divano accanto a lei."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:15
translate italian jamietv1_48789a88:

    # "The show starts up pretty soon after we sit down, and I try to watch while Jamie talks through every scene, explaining who all the characters are."
    "Lo spettacolo inizia poco dopo che ci siamo seduti, e cerco di guardarlo mentre Jamie commenta ogni scena, spiegandomi chi sono tutti i personaggi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:18
translate italian jamietv1_f26b00c3:

    # "Over time, she moves closer to me so she doesn't have to speak as loudly for me to hear her during the show."
    "Col passare del tempo, si avvicina a me così non deve parlare a voce così alta perché io la senta durante la puntata."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:19
translate italian jamietv1_7488a7ce:

    # gnd "See Cyndi is the older sister and she was married to Winston, but they got divorced and now she's dating Elroy."
    gnd "Vedi, Cyndi è la sorella maggiore ed era sposata con Winston, ma hanno divorziato e ora sta uscendo con Elroy."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:20
translate italian jamietv1_e33871b4:

    # gnd "The younger sister is Carolyn..."
    gnd "La sorella minore è Carolyn..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:21
translate italian jamietv1_76d94bb8:

    # "She goes on like this for a while, giving me the recap of the last eight seasons of this show that I don't care about in the slightest."
    "Continua così per un po’, fornendomi il riassunto delle ultime otto stagioni di questa serie che non mi interessa minimamente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:22
translate italian jamietv1_2078b7b8:

    # "I just watch her, my eyes roaming over every inch of her body, nodding along as her mouth moved, thinking about how it would feel to kiss those lips."
    "Mi limito a guardarla, con lo sguardo che vaga su ogni centimetro del suo corpo, annuendo mentre muove le labbra, pensando a come sarebbe baciare quelle labbra."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:23
translate italian jamietv1_e50f84f6:

    # "I have a hard time taking my eyes away from her to watch the screen."
    "Faccio fatica a distogliere lo sguardo da lei per guardare lo schermo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:24
translate italian jamietv1_dec3d4b8:

    # "I think about putting my arm around her. I want to hold her close, to feel her warmth against me."
    "Penso di metterle un braccio intorno alle spalle. Voglio stringerla a me, sentire il suo calore contro il mio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:25
translate italian jamietv1_1ebc9500:

    # "But I'm afraid of pushing too far, too fast, too soon after finally fixing our relationship."
    "Ma ho paura di spingermi troppo oltre, troppo in fretta, troppo presto dopo aver finalmente sistemato la nostra relazione."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:27
translate italian jamietv1_4aa5af9b:

    # "When the show ends and the sappy music starts up while the credits roll, she looks up at me and I look into her eyes."
    "Quando lo spettacolo finisce e parte quella musica sdolcinata mentre scorrono i titoli di coda, lei alza lo sguardo verso di me e io la guardo negli occhi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:28
translate italian jamietv1_0e8a8301:

    # "A moment passes between us. We don't say anything, but I can see that she likes me just as much as I like her."
    "Tra noi scorre un momento di silenzio. Non diciamo nulla, ma capisco che io le piaccio tanto quanto lei piace a me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:29
translate italian jamietv1_d17d6173:

    # "I can see that she wants me to kiss her."
    "Vedo che vuole che la baci."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:31
translate italian jamietv1_c26dfc22:

    # "I lean in, our lips only millimeters away."
    "Mi avvicino, le nostre labbra sono a pochi millimetri di distanza."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:32
translate italian jamietv1_574266fe:

    # "Then the front door opens and Jamie's dad walks in."
    "Poi la porta d’ingresso si apre ed entra il papà di Jamie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:35
translate italian jamietv1_9ebb9cac:

    # "He looks directly at me, his face immediately dropping into a bulldog-like scowl."
    "Mi guarda dritto negli occhi, e il suo volto si incupisce immediatamente in un’espressione accigliata da bulldog."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:38
translate italian jamietv1_ceb35d85:

    # "Jamie pulls away from me quickly and rushes over to him."
    "Jamie si allontana rapidamente da me e si precipita da lui."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:39
translate italian jamietv1_eda53ec0:

    # gnd "Hi, Daddy. I made lasagna for dinner. There's some wrapped in foil in the fridge for you to warm up."
    gnd "Ciao, papà. Ho preparato le lasagne per cena. Ce n’è un po’ avvolta nella carta stagnola in frigo, così puoi scaldartele."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:41
translate italian jamietv1_72f1a03e:

    # jd "Sounds great, honey."
    jd "Sembra fantastico, tesoro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:45
translate italian jamietv1_f2a9fe7e:

    # "He walks up to her and wraps her in a hug."
    "Si avvicina a lei e la stringe in un abbraccio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:46
translate italian jamietv1_dee4a8d0:

    # jd "It's late. Send him home."
    jd "È tardi. Mandalo a casa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:47
translate italian jamietv1_1976ecec:

    # "With that, he walks past me into the kitchen without ever laying eyes on me."
    "Detto questo, mi passa accanto ed entra in cucina senza nemmeno guardarmi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:51
translate italian jamietv1_d4db5419:

    # pc "I guess it is late. I should get out of here."
    pc "Immagino sia tardi. Dovrei andarmene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:53
translate italian jamietv1_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_009b.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_009b.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:54
translate italian jamietv1_c2f845d0:

    # gnd "I'm sorry. I'm trying with him. I told him that you've changed, but he doesn't want to hear it."
    gnd "Mi dispiace. Ci sto provando con lui. Gli ho detto che sei cambiata, ma non vuole sentirne parlare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:55
translate italian jamietv1_ce223137:

    # pc "It's okay. I understand."
    pc "Va bene. Capisco."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:57
translate italian jamietv1_6c7c60bd:

    # gnd "I had fun watching the show with you though. Maybe we can do it again sometime?"
    gnd "Mi sono divertito a guardare lo spettacolo con te, però. Magari potremmo rifarlo qualche volta?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:58
translate italian jamietv1_0691c9a4:

    # pc "I'd love to."
    pc "Mi piacerebbe molto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:59
translate italian jamietv1_6260e3d8:

    # "I don't care anything about the show, but I definitely want to spend some more time alone with her."
    "Non mi interessa nulla dello spettacolo, ma voglio decisamente passare ancora un po’ di tempo da solo con lei."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:60
translate italian jamietv1_6ce29231:

    # "It had felt like a spark had ignited between us in that moment where we almost kissed, but now it's gone. I want to feel that again."
    "Mi era sembrato che tra noi fosse scoccata una scintilla in quel momento in cui ci siamo quasi baciati, ma ora è svanita. Voglio provarla di nuovo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:61
translate italian jamietv1_5a7eedfa:

    # gnd "Okay, well..."
    gnd "Ok, beh..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:62
translate italian jamietv1_f08905dc:

    # pc "Yeah, yeah, I'm leaving."
    pc "Sì, sì, me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:66
translate italian jamietv1_17ddf074:

    # "She walks me to the door and we say our goodnights before I walk back over to my house."
    "Mi accompagna alla porta e ci salutiamo prima che io torni a casa mia."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:67
translate italian jamietv1_d1f5525f:

    # "If her dad had come in just a minute or two later, this night would have gone much better."
    "Se suo padre fosse entrato solo un minuto o due più tardi, questa serata sarebbe andata molto meglio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv1.rpy:68
translate italian jamietv1_a07dd7b4:

    # "Even so, it wasn't too bad."
    "Comunque, non è andata poi così male."

